## Files

- `plugin.config.json` — plugin metadata and discovery config.
- `index.ts` — JSX-free entry object; icons use `createElement`.
- Generated `.tsx` components for the selected UI hooks.

No `package.json` is generated. The host webapp provides React, TypeScript,
Vite, and `@/plugin-system`.

## Wiring

Copy this folder to dicoogle-next:

```bash
cp -R . /path/to/dicoogle-next/webapp/src/plugins/{{id}}
cd /path/to/dicoogle-next/webapp
npm ci
npm run lint
npm run type-check
npm run build
```

Restart Vite after adding a new directory; the plugin loader discovers new
folders at startup and does not watch for them.

